    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Junebug has found himself under attack by the forces of evil. Equipped with a growing arsenal of weapons and supplies found around his cabin, he's ready to fight against evil for as long as he can. The first wave finds you almost unprepared but the longer you survive, the more you'll be equipped to destroy anything that lurks in the darkness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667590/extras/42fe41f7e90c812405631c2fa7e48e72.avif?t=1740781044\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Each Wave Brings New Terror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive wave after wave as enemies grow in power and number. Use scrap collected from lootables and enemies to upgrade your arsenal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast-Paced Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find scrap, loot enemies, upgrade weapons, and fight until you can't. See how far you can survive!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Junebug has found himself under attack by the forces of evil. Equipped with a growing arsenal of weapons and supplies found around his cabin, he's ready to fight against evil for as long as he can. The first wave finds you almost unprepared but the longer you survive, the more you'll be equipped to destroy anything that lurks in the darkness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667590/extras/42fe41f7e90c812405631c2fa7e48e72.avif?t=1740781044\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Each Wave Brings New Terror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive wave after wave as enemies grow in power and number. Use scrap collected from lootables and enemies to upgrade your arsenal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast-Paced Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find scrap, loot enemies, upgrade weapons, and fight until you can't. See how far you can survive!</p>",
    "short_description": "Junebug vs. Evil is a chaotic, survival-horde game that takes inspiration from retro horror movies. Battle your way through waves of evil using anything you can find, from assault rifles to homemade firebombs. The terrors that lurk in these Appalachian woods grow stronger each wave, but so do you!",
